---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import { withBase } from "@/lib/utils";
---

<section id="inicio" class="scroll-mt-24">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.15fr)_minmax(16rem,0.75fr)]">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-muted-foreground">
        Desenvolvedor Full Stack
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 font-display text-5xl font-medium leading-[1.05] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
        Ygor <span class="italic text-accent-link">Calimanis</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-foreground/90">
        Transformo regras de negócio em aplicações web, APIs e integrações estáveis — do entendimento do problema à entrega que evolui com o produto.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        Atuo no frontend e no backend com foco em clareza, manutenibilidade e experiência do usuário. Compreendo necessidades reais para construir soluções eficientes, sem ruído e sem atalhos que comprometam o longo prazo.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="#projetos"
          class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-primary px-5 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground hover:opacity-90"
        >
          Ver projetos
        </a>
        <a
          href={withBase("docs/curriculo-ygor-calimanis.pdf")}
          download
          class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md border border-border px-5 text-sm font-medium hover:border-accent hover:text-accent-link"
        >
          Baixar currículo
        </a>
        <a
          href="#contato"
          class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center px-2 text-sm font-medium text-accent-link underline-offset-4 hover:underline"
        >
          Contato
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5 text-sm">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/calimanisYgor"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground"
        >
          <Icon name="mdi:github" size={20} />
          GitHub
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ygorcalimanis"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground"
        >
          <Icon name="mdi:linkedin" size={20} />
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- <div class="reveal mx-auto w-full max-w-sm lg:mx-0 lg:justify-self-end">
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-3">
        <img
          src={withBase("ygor.jpg")}
          alt="Retrato profissional de Ygor Calimanis"
          class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-xl object-cover object-top"
          width="640"
          height="800"
        />
      </div>
    </div> -->
  </div>
</section>
